stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unknown

    Unknown --> OfferReceived: OFFER received
    OfferReceived --> AlreadyKnown: message is already<br>present and visible
    OfferReceived --> OfferMessageStored: message is unknown<br>and offer capacity available
    OfferReceived --> OfferIgnored: offer capacity reached

    AlreadyKnown --> AckEligible: ACK flag set
    OfferMessageStored --> RequestEligible: offered message MessageStored

    RequestEligible --> RequestQueued: selected<br>offered entry removed
    RequestQueued --> RequestSent: REQUEST written<br>to stream
    RequestQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed

    RequestSent --> WaitingForMessage

    WaitingForMessage --> MessageReceived: MESSAGE received
    WaitingForMessage --> OfferReceived: OFFER retransmitted

    Unknown --> MessageReceived: MESSAGE received directly
    AlreadyKnown --> MessageReceived: duplicate MESSAGE received

    MessageReceived --> MessageAccepted: structurally valid<br>and group visible
    MessageReceived --> MessageIgnored: group not visible
    MessageReceived --> SessionFailed: malformed record

    MessageAccepted --> MessageStored: new message MessageStored
    MessageAccepted --> DuplicateKnown: message already present

    MessageStored --> AckEligible: ACK flag set
    DuplicateKnown --> AckEligible: seen and ACK flags set

    AckEligible --> AckQueued: selected<br>ACK flag cleared
    AckQueued --> Acknowledged: ACK written<br>to stream
    AckQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed

    Acknowledged --> [*]
    OfferIgnored --> [*]
    MessageIgnored --> [*]
    SessionFailed --> [*]